<title>FRANCE: Pernod Ricard to pay 4 Ffr interim div.</title>
<headline>Pernod Ricard to pay 4 Ffr interim div.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>French drinks grooup Pernod Ricard said in a statement on Friday that it would make a net interim dividend payment of four francs on January 14.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
